[0m$ [0mcd "/home/nico/Documents/U/Co/U/4s/courses/interfaces/tareas/proyecto final/juego" && git add -A && git commit -q -m "Asset pipeline: chroma-key + band slicing -> gameplay atlases

Turns the character reference sheets into real sprite atlases. The sheets put
their rows close together enough that centre-based bucketing drifted and
mis-ordered clips, so rows are declared explicitly and the N largest components
per band are taken left to right, which also drops the non-body frames (the
green projectile among the sorcerer's poses).

statue.jpeg is a labeled design board, so Section 1 is subdivided into 12 equal
columns rather than component-detected: neighbouring poses touch and merge.

Figures are baseline-locked into shared cells. Tight per-frame crops animate
with a visible wobble; this is what makes the animation read as one character." && git log --oneline && mkdir -p js/vendor js/core js/render js/game/boss js/ui css && curl -sL -o js/vendor/three.module.js https://unpkg.com/three@0.170.0/build/three.module.js && ls -la js/vendor/ && head -c 120 js/vendor/three.module.js
