than a fixed screen fraction; these levels are barely taller than the viewport,
so they were showing a band of void under the floor.

The Marble Mummy rendered as a faint ghost: the atlas was graded too dark and
the 1px outline flooded its low-alpha body. Fixed at the source (brighter
atlas, outline threshold 0.6 -> 0.85) rather than in the shader.
